# 审批人还没定。@REPLACE-WITH-OWNER 是仓库所有者本人，@REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER 是专门的审核账号。
# 这两个都是占位，不是真实用户。
# 占位账号不存在时 GitHub 会静默跳过该规则，Code Owner 审批形同虚设。
# 必须替换为对仓库有写权限的真实账号，然后执行：
#   gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/codeowners/errors
# 返回的 errors 为空才算配好。
# Cargo.lock 不在这份名单里。

/.github/ @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
/.cargo/ @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
/vendor/ @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
/contracts/ @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
/supply-chain/ @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
/Cargo.toml @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
/deny.toml @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
/clippy.toml @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
/rustfmt.toml @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
/rust-toolchain @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
/rust-toolchain.toml @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
/unsafe-crates.txt @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
/build.rs @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
**/build.rs @REPLACE-WITH-OWNER @REPLACE-WITH-REVIEWER
